  "bio": "Discover a realm of artistry at BavariastichTattoo, where the \"Mad Penciler & Crazy Catlady\" duo excels in shades of black and gray, transforming skin into a canvas of timeless masterpieces. Dive into an oasis of creativity catering to all styles, specializing in striking cover-ups. Secure your spot in this sanctuary of ink with a call or email, and let your tattoo journey begin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nRosenheim\n📧 email         info@bavaria-stich.de \n☎️ Shop            08031 7969306\n📳 WhatsApp   0151 2 88 399 38\nResident artist and owner  Eva Santl",
